---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Affiliate & Advertising Disclosure — Toolora" description="Toolora's policy for affiliate links, sponsored placements and advertising transparency.">
  <SiteHeader />
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Disclosure</div><span class="eyebrow">Transparency</span><h1 class="display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold mt-3">Affiliate & advertising disclosure.</h1><p class="text-slate-500 mt-3 text-sm max-w-2xl">How Toolora handles recommendations, partnerships and paid placements.</p></div></section>
    <section class="section"><div class="container max-w-3xl grid gap-5">
      <article class="tool-panel p-6 md:p-8"><h2 class="display text-2xl font-bold">Current status</h2><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-7 mt-3">Toolora participates in the Ezitech affiliate programme and publishes tracked referral links on its Ezitech services page. Toolora does not currently claim to have an approved display-ad account or paid sponsored placements.</p></article>
      <article class="tool-panel p-6 md:p-8"><h2 class="display text-2xl font-bold">Affiliate links</h2><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-7 mt-3">Links on the Ezitech services page are affiliate referral links. If a visitor contacts Ezitech through one of those links and later makes a qualifying purchase, Toolora may receive a commission. The visitor does not pay an extra fee because of Toolora’s referral. Commission rates and qualifying services are described on the partner page and are subject to Ezitech’s current programme terms. Toolora does not control Ezitech’s pricing, delivery, support or final service quality. Please assess the provider and scope directly before purchasing.</p></article>
      <article class="tool-panel p-6 md:p-8"><h2 class="display text-2xl font-bold">Sponsored content and advertising</h2><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-7 mt-3">Paid placements will be labelled as sponsored or advertising. Toolora will not publish fabricated reviews, ratings, testimonials, traffic figures or earnings claims. Editorial descriptions should remain distinguishable from paid promotions.</p></article>
      <article class="tool-panel p-6 md:p-8"><h2 class="display text-2xl font-bold">Questions</h2><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-7 mt-3">For questions about Toolora’s website, use the <a class="text-brand-700 underline" href="/community/">Toolora Community</a> page. For service details, visit the <a class="text-brand-700 underline" href="/partners/ezitech/">Ezitech partner page</a>.</p></article>
    </div></section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</SiteLayout>
